### 1. Inscription (crée le compte si la base est neuve)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "etudiant1",
  "password": "mon_mot_de_passe_securise"
}

### 2. Connexion et capture automatique du token
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "etudiant1",
  "password": "mon_mot_de_passe_securise"
}

> {%
  if (response.status === 200 && response.body.access_token) {
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.access_token);
  }
%}

### 3. Vérification de la session active (avec token -> 200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 4. Test d'accès refusé (sans token -> 401)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/auth/me

### 5. Prédiction IA réelle (SimpleCNN CIFAR-10 -> 200)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/predict
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_name": "test_cifar10.png",
  "image_base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNk+A8AAQUBAScY42YAAAAASUVORK5CYII="
}

### 6. Attaque adversariale réelle - FGSM (-> 200)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/attack
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_name": "test_cifar10.png",
  "image_base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNk+A8AAQUBAScY42YAAAAASUVORK5CYII=",
  "epsilon": 0.1
}

### 7. Défense - Adversarial Training (-> 503 tant que robust_cifar10.pt est absent, sinon 200)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/defend
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image_name": "test_cifar10.png",
  "image_base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNk+A8AAQUBAScY42YAAAAASUVORK5CYII="
}

### 8. Historique des expériences de l'utilisateur connecté (-> 200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/history?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}